# 🚀 Chat Application Backend

A robust, real-time chat backend built with Node.js, Express.js, and Socket.IO for instant messaging with MongoDB for persistent storage.

## 🛠️ Backend Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| **Node.js** | Runtime environment |
| **Express.js** | Web framework for API routes |
| **MongoDB with Mongoose** | Database & ODM for data modeling |
| **Socket.IO** | Real-time bidirectional communication |
| **JSON Web Tokens (JWT)** | Authentication & authorization |
| **Bcrypt** | Password hashing for security |
| **CORS** | Cross-origin resource sharing |

## 📋 Prerequisites

- Node.js (v18 or higher)
- MongoDB (local or MongoDB Atlas)
- npm or yarn package manager


